- You must provide accurate information\n
- You are responsible for maintaining account security\n\n
2. Points and Rewards\n
- Points are earned through legitimate gameplay\n
- We reserve the right to verify point accumulation\n
- Points have no monetary value until redeemed\n\n
3. Fair Play\n
- Cheating or exploitation will result in account termination\n
- Multiple accounts are not permitted</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_text">Privacy Policy for PixelPayout\n\n
1. Information We Collect\n
- Account information (email, name)\n
- Game activity and points earned\n
- Device information\n\n
2. How We Use Information\n
- To provide and improve services\n
- To verify rewards eligibility\n
- To prevent fraud\n\n
3. Data Security\n
- We implement industry-standard security measures\n
- Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest</string>
